      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Preinstall multiple hosts with {"{"}{"{"} sno {"}"}{"}"} at a central site, such as a service depot or a factory. Then, validate the base configuration for these hosts and leverage the image-based approach to perform reproducible factory installs at scale by using a single live installation ISO.</p></dd>
